OL,3,GNEWSA'Dogfather' having time of his
OL,4,Alife on Strictly
OL,5,
OL,6,FTV dog trainer Graeme Hall says taking
OL,7,Fpart in Strictly Come Dancing has given
OL,8,Fhim "the time of my life" as he
OL,9,Fcontinues his journey on the BBC show.
OL,11,FThe Brackley-based Dogs Behaving (Very)
OL,12,FBadly star, dubbed the Dogfather, is
OL,13,Fpartnered with professional dancer
OL,14,FLauren Oakley and has made it to week
OL,15,Feight of the competition.
OL,17,FHall said he believing he would never
OL,18,Fbe able to dance again after suffering
OL,19,Fa stroke in 2019 as a result of a hole
OL,20,Fin the heart condition.
